%% frame: UC5 basic flow 1: the last seat fills the team (analysis)
sequenceDiagram
    participant J as JoinTeamControl (control)
    participant T as Team (entity)
    participant R as ResolveTeamControl (control)
    participant O as Order (entity)

    Note over J,T: UC4 B7 admits a paid buyer (@fig-a-uc04-as-basic-2)
    J->>T: B1: admit(buyer, payment)
    alt admitted and currentSize + 1 = targetSize
        T->>T: B2: canMoveTo(SUCCEEDED)
        T-->>J: admitted, team filled
        J->>R: B3: teamFilled(team)
        loop each pending order of the team
            R->>O: B3: confirm()
        end
        Note over R,O: B4: the result is published for members (design only)
    else admitted, seats remain
        T-->>J: admitted, team still open
    else refused: team resolved, full or closed (A4)
        T-->>J: refused
        Note over J: UC4 A6: the payment is owed a refund
    end
